msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫if but briefly, when I was happy? When I felt human emotions?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫分かってくれたでしょうか？"

#: search2:search2_6828E224_0986_4005_83AF_F218D0C220AC
