msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“My sister has fallen very ill, and she desperately needs medicine.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「妹が重い病気にかかっていて、どうしても薬が欲しいんです」"

#: search2:search2_5C1F80B5_C353_4B86_A024_558C35E11706
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17615472ccfac8e15ea63be5f6d1f64a142012a86b6e9fe8bea670bfbe62f1b9
#. default-sha256: 69801e46aa007f6782e89fc4410f5a3577cec274faa8546253256a5c55b4591e
msgctxt "search2:search2_5C1F80B5_C353_4B86_A024_558C35E11706"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫According to him, his younger sister had fallen gravely ill, and though they had tried "
"a number of remedies, she was still bedridden. ⟪k:2⟫The medicines I gave him too had no effect, "
"but he persisted in his quest, visiting me again and again for new combinations to try.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫He wanted nothing more than to relieve even the slightest bit of his sister’s suffering. "
"⟪k:6⟫And, moved by his dedication to his family, I too wanted to do anything I could to help.⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫For the first time in years, my world encompassed more than my small cottage."
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫When the young man came, he would ask not only for medicine—but to go on "
"walks with me. ⟪k:15⟫He ⟪k:16⟫volunteered⟪k:17⟫ to spend time with me, despite my horrifying "
"appearance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　どうやら彼の妹は、若くして重い病に倒れ、どんな薬を試そうとも起き上がれない状態にあるようで"
"した。⟪k:1⟫私が渡した薬もやはり効果は出なかったようなのですが、それでも彼は足繁く私の小屋に通い続"
"けました。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　少しでも妹が楽になる薬が欲しかったのでしょう。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　私は彼の家族を思う"
"心に打たれ、役に立ってあげたいと思うようになり始めていました。⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　私の閉じていた世界"
"は、こうして、ひとりの青年によって再び開かれたのです。⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫　彼は、私から薬を貰うだけ"
"でなく、私を散歩に誘いました。⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫　こんな気色の悪い顔をした女と、並んで歩きたいと言うので"
"す。"

#: search2:search2_244B3A92_0001_4CC4_831E_B498831F882E
